Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|layout.parallel.render.enable=false|
		|extraapps.plugins.includes|content-targeting|
		|ignore.errors|IX_DC6100CC|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|false|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.component.names|Content Targeting|
		|testray.main.component.name|Content Targeting|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet start Server
	And User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingUserSegment add CP
		|userSegmentDescription|User Segment Description|
		|userSegmentName|User Segment Name|
	Then PortletEntry save

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Campaign Content CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.jpg|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Content CP
		|contentMetricName|Content Metric Name|
		|contentTitle|DM Document Title|
		|contentTrackingActionSelect|View|
		|menulistContent|Basic Document|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign view Tracking Actions CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|contentMetricName|Content Metric Name|
		|contentTitle|DM Document Title|
		|viewTrackingActionsList|Content|

Scenario: Add Campaign Custom Form CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Custom Form CP
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formId|Form id|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign view Tracking Actions CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formId|Form id|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
		|viewTrackingActionsList|Custom Form|

Scenario: Add Campaign DDL Form CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action DDL Form CP
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formName|Created Form Name|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Edit Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	Then ContentTargetingCampaign view Tracking Actions CP
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|formAlias|Form Alias|
		|formName|Created Form Name|
		|formTrackingActionSelect|Submit|
		|viewTrackingActionsList|Form|

