Scenario: Add Campaign You Tube CP
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|content.targeting.release|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add CP
		|campaignDescription|Campaign Description|
		|campaignEndDate|1/1/2099|
		|campaignEndTime|12:00 PM|
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
		|campaignPriorityField|3|
		|campaignStartDate|1/1/2015|
		|campaignStartTime|12:00 AM|
		|userSegmentSelect|User Segment Name|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And Navigator goto Nav Tab
		|navTab|Configuration|
	And ContentTargeting enable Analytics
		|analyticsList|YouTube Videos|
	And PortletEntry save
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Audience Targeting|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign goto Add Report
		|campaignName|Campaign Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Report Name
		|reportDescription|Content Report Description|
		|reportName|Content Report Name|
	And ContentTargetingCampaign add Tracking Action Youtubevideos CP
